### Ensure off-chain settlement exists (seed concert 1) then build settle_concert
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/concerts/1/settle
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "grossUsdc": 875.00
}

### Build settle_concert DevNet instruction (wallet signs next)
# 409 until the concert's band vault is active (BandVault.http); then 200 with
# bandVault + member profile remaining accounts and per-member pendingUsdc
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/concert-settlements/1/settle-concert/build
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC"
}

### Reject settle confirm without txSignature
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/concert-settlements/1/settle-concert/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "concertSettlementPda": "ConcertSettlePda111111111111111111111111111"
}

### Build claim_royalties DevNet instruction
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/pending-claims/1/claim-royalties/build
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "vaultUsdcAta": "VaultUsdcAta1111111111111111111111111111111",
  "musicianUsdcAta": "MusicianUsdcAta11111111111111111111111111"
}

### Reject claim confirm without txSignature (must not mark claimed)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/pending-claims/1/claim-royalties/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "claimPda": "MusicianProfilePda1111111111111111111111111"
}

### Legacy Mark claimed must return 400
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/pending-claims/1/claim
